      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/y/779978/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-21T13:28:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I love SotM, but I always thought it would be fun to take on a Villain 1 on 1 sometime. Clearly the game is not designed for this, but it could be.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The Vengenace villains were clearly designed to work together as a team, which made sense from a story perspective, but with Villains it would be cool if they would be set up to work by themselves. This would allow 1 on 1 duels between 1 hero and 1 Villain. I think this would be blast. I think it would also create a ton of excitment for Villains.&nbsp;</p><p>I have already put my preorder in for Villains, but I would be very pumped if they allowed solo hero games.&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:30.011Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
