      "raw": "[quote=\"youperguy\"]\n\nI love SotM, but I always thought it would be fun to take on a Villain 1 on 1 sometime. Clearly the game is not designed for this, but it could be.&nbsp;&nbsp;The Vengenace villains were clearly designed to work together as a team, which made sense from a story perspective, but with Villains it would be cool if they would be set up to work by themselves. This would allow 1 on 1 duels between 1 hero and 1 Villain. I think this would be blast. I think it would also create a ton of excitment for Villains.&nbsp;I have already put my preorder in for Villains, but I would be very pumped if they allowed solo hero games.&nbsp;\n\n[/quote]\n\nIt&#39;s not an officially supported way to play, but since the Veangence format villains do not use the [H] mechanic for scaling purposes, you could certainly play 1v1 like this. Some combinations will be better than others since it is not balanced this way, but nothing is stoping you from doing it!\n",
